# The router's RFM69 does not answer (missing, unpowered or badly wired, MISO held
# low): its initialization fails and nothing goes on air, but the main loop keeps
# running. The override pin, read by the main loop, still forces the local loads.
include common.scn
duration 20
rf_absent
input 4 0 10    # override pin pulled low at 10 s

at 0 -200 -200 -200

expect 9 pin 5 off
expect 15 pin 5 on
expect 15 pin 6 on
expect 19 remote 15 0 off
expect 19 remote 16 0 off
